OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over construction of    
OL,4,Aproposed reservoir                     
OL,6,FQuestions have been raised over the    
OL,7,Fbuilding of a proposed new reservoir in
OL,8,FLincolnshire.                          
OL,10,FAnglian Water wants to construct a     
OL,11,Freservoir near Scredington and Burton  
OL,12,FPedwardine, south of Sleaford, that    
OL,13,Fwould supply water to about 500,000    
OL,14,Fhomes.                                 
OL,16,FRichard Wright, leader of North        
OL,17,FKesteven District Council, said he     
OL,18,Fwanted more details about how          
OL,19,Fconstruction materials and water would 
OL,20,Fbe taken to the site and what impact   
OL,21,Fthe work would have on residents.      
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
