OL,3,GNEWSAQuestions over construction of    
OL,4,Aproposed reservoir                     
OL,6,FAnglian Water said it was looking to   
OL,7,Fmitigate the impact on traffic during  
OL,8,Fconstruction and was considering using 
OL,9,Funderground pipelines, although it     
OL,10,Fwould prefer to use existing waterways.
